   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Blue dashed: the original\n44 × 22 m office.\n\nDepartment zones come\nfrom contracts/zones.json\n(15 zones, 21 desks, no\nnew ones). Finance,\nCreators and Growth\nmoved into the wings\n(layout.ts ZONE_MOVES),\nSwitch cables follow.\n\nPastel rooms (ANNEX):\nweb-only, room to walk.\n\nCamera: eye-level third\nperson behind the founder\n(ported from agent-office,\nMIT). Stand still while the\nstory plays and it glides\nto whoever is talking.\nSpectator view: the eye\nbutton.\n\n1 grid unit = 1 m",
   "originalText": "Blue dashed: the original\n44 × 22 m office.\n\nDepartment zones come\nfrom contracts/zones.json\n(15 zones, 21 desks, no\nnew ones). Finance,\nCreators and Growth\nmoved into the wings\n(layout.ts ZONE_MOVES),\nSwitch cables follow.\n\nPastel rooms (ANNEX):\nweb-only, room to walk.\n\nCamera: eye-level third\nperson behind the founder\n(ported from agent-office,\nMIT). Stand still while the\nstory plays and it glides\nto whoever is talking.\nSpectator view: the eye\nbutton.\n\n1 grid unit = 1 m",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "re66",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
